WEBVTT

01:38.520 --> 01:41.880
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:56.680 --> 01:57.520
I…

01:59.360 --> 02:00.520
It's you?

02:05.880 --> 02:06.760
My lord.

02:07.680 --> 02:08.560
It's been a while.

02:09.960 --> 02:12.040
So, he's the one you spoke of?

02:14.840 --> 02:17.320
Don't you know that he attacked Yanzhou
mere months ago,

02:17.400 --> 02:20.040
causing us tens of thousands
of casualties?

02:21.240 --> 02:23.400
I offended you before.

02:23.840 --> 02:26.040
But may I now have
the chance to redeem myself?

02:26.120 --> 02:27.520
If we join hands this time,

02:27.600 --> 02:29.600
we could help you reclaim true authority

02:29.680 --> 02:31.760
and take back Panyi for Yanzhou.

02:32.840 --> 02:34.120
Panyi?

02:35.560 --> 02:38.280
What nonsense are you talking about?

02:41.560 --> 02:43.200
Governor, you're a man of great talent,

02:43.280 --> 02:44.280
wise and formidable in battle,

02:44.360 --> 02:46.480
much like the late Lord Qiao.

02:47.000 --> 02:49.800
But your brother
has long coveted your position.

02:49.880 --> 02:51.480
He has plotted carefully.

02:51.560 --> 02:52.800
Now he controls the troops

02:52.880 --> 02:54.840
and has Wei Shao as his son-in-law.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.640
As the Governor of Yanzhou,

02:57.720 --> 02:59.600
can you truly accept being beneath him?

03:00.280 --> 03:02.120
What's the point of these words?

03:04.800 --> 03:07.360
If Wei Shao falls,
Yanzhou will be the strongest force.

03:07.880 --> 03:09.960
Qiao Ping will be left without support.

03:10.400 --> 03:13.920
If you will not submit to him,
why not take a chance?

03:19.160 --> 03:20.920
You want to kill the Lord of Wei?

03:24.000 --> 03:26.600
Wei State now draws strength
from all regions to build the canal.

03:26.680 --> 03:29.120
Soon, their strength will be unstoppable.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.320
If we don't act now,

03:31.400 --> 03:33.240
there may never be another chance.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.320
Over the past months,

03:35.400 --> 03:36.920
I've reached out to many forces

03:37.000 --> 03:39.200
and rallied troops to resist Wei State.

03:39.280 --> 03:41.200
Xue Tai, a valiant warrior,
has also pledged support.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.160
We'll strike from two fronts.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.200
Everything is ready,

03:44.280 --> 03:45.640
except your resolve

03:45.720 --> 03:47.960
to cast off Wei State's yoke.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.800
So, you've come to persuade me?

04:04.400 --> 04:05.920
I have come today

04:06.000 --> 04:08.000
only seeking a powerful alliance with you

04:08.080 --> 04:09.280
to crush Wei State

04:10.120 --> 04:11.440
and divide its lands.

04:24.840 --> 04:26.160
Ping, my brother.

04:26.240 --> 04:29.160
It's been a long time
since we had an evening like this,

04:29.240 --> 04:30.800
just sitting and drinking together.

04:32.240 --> 04:36.320
Let me take this chance
to toast you first.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.280
Bottoms up.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.880
I know I'm mediocre.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.600
All these years,

04:51.280 --> 04:54.040
it's you who held everything together.

04:55.360 --> 04:56.920
I'm proud of you,

04:57.000 --> 04:59.720
but also ashamed that I've done so little.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.760
Here's a second cup

05:01.840 --> 05:03.240
to show my respect.

05:03.720 --> 05:04.560
Yue,

05:05.920 --> 05:07.080
please don't put me on a pedestal.

05:08.160 --> 05:09.320
If not for you,

05:09.400 --> 05:11.080
who always showed such grace,

05:11.160 --> 05:13.840
what could I have done alone?

05:14.800 --> 05:17.120
I should be the one to toast you.

05:23.600 --> 05:24.920
Very well.

05:25.840 --> 05:27.400
As long as we stand united,

05:27.480 --> 05:29.040
there's nothing we can't overcome.

05:29.800 --> 05:30.640
Cheers.

05:40.680 --> 05:42.280
I have something

05:42.360 --> 05:44.000
to tell you, Ping.

05:45.600 --> 05:46.560
Please go on.

05:48.800 --> 05:50.160
I've decided

05:51.160 --> 05:52.800
to lead Yanzhou

05:52.880 --> 05:54.880
into an allegiance with Liu Yan,
Lord of Liangya,

05:54.960 --> 05:57.400
and sever all ties
with Wei Shao of Wei State.

06:01.240 --> 06:02.240
Why?

06:04.520 --> 06:05.440
No…

06:05.800 --> 06:06.640
Wait.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.000
Why didn't you

06:10.400 --> 06:12.200
say a word of this beforehand?

06:12.840 --> 06:14.360
Ping, what do you mean?

06:15.040 --> 06:19.480
Must I seek your permission
for every decision?

06:22.840 --> 06:24.400
That's not what I meant.

06:25.360 --> 06:26.320
Right now,

06:26.920 --> 06:29.480
the realm is in turmoil
and its future uncertain.

06:30.360 --> 06:32.080
Yanzhou, for the moment,

06:32.160 --> 06:33.800
can still hold its own.

06:33.880 --> 06:35.480
In my view,

06:35.560 --> 06:37.440
we should wait and observe.

06:37.520 --> 06:39.480
It's unwise to turn to Liangya so hastily.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.400
Yue,

06:45.480 --> 06:46.720
have you considered the fact

06:47.600 --> 06:50.560
that our Qiao clan and the Wei clan
are in-laws now?

06:51.160 --> 06:53.640
If one is in trouble,

06:53.720 --> 06:55.920
the other should come to their aid.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.720
Even if we don't,

06:57.800 --> 06:59.560
we shouldn't betray them.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.800
So in the end,

07:02.720 --> 07:05.320
you just want to tie Yanzhou's fate

07:05.400 --> 07:07.000
and the Qiao clan's

07:07.560 --> 07:09.920
to Wei Shao?

07:10.400 --> 07:11.480
Am I right?

07:13.160 --> 07:16.840
Back when our families proposed
the marriage alliance,

07:17.480 --> 07:20.080
Yue, you supported it too.

07:20.720 --> 07:22.160
But now,

07:22.240 --> 07:24.520
at the first sign of trouble,

07:24.600 --> 07:26.600
you're ready to turn your back on them!

07:27.040 --> 07:28.840
How is this

07:29.400 --> 07:31.600
any different

07:32.160 --> 07:33.200
from being a turncoat?

07:37.000 --> 07:39.400
How dare you speak to me this way?

07:40.160 --> 07:42.200
Do you still see me as your elder brother?

07:43.000 --> 07:45.480
Remember, I am the Governor of Yanzhou!

07:52.120 --> 07:53.440
I have no sons.

07:54.160 --> 07:55.560
I treat Ci as my own.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.960
Why do you think I'm doing this?

07:57.040 --> 07:58.720
Do you really believe it's for myself?

07:58.800 --> 08:01.400
I'm doing this for Yanzhou's future!

08:05.000 --> 08:05.920
Know this.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.520
My alliance with Liangya

08:07.600 --> 08:09.320
is not open to your objections!

08:23.600 --> 08:24.440
You…

08:26.360 --> 08:27.880
You drugged my wine!

08:27.960 --> 08:29.200
No, I didn't.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.400
- I didn't.
- My eyes…

08:35.360 --> 08:36.400
You traitor!

08:42.320 --> 08:43.159
Traitor…

08:52.840 --> 08:53.880
Is he dead?

08:55.600 --> 08:56.600
He's still breathing.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.280
What did you give him?

08:58.360 --> 08:59.520
Why can't he see anything?

09:00.120 --> 09:01.440
I don't know.

09:01.520 --> 09:03.040
Liu Shan gave me the drug.

09:03.120 --> 09:05.280
He said it was much stronger than
ordinary knockout drops.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.920
It must be his rage that did it.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.560
It must have triggered
temporary blindness.

09:09.640 --> 09:10.920
He might recover in a few days.

09:13.120 --> 09:16.520
My lord, our top priority must be
to seize control,

09:16.600 --> 09:17.880
take back command of the troops,

09:17.960 --> 09:19.160
and take charge of the situation.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.600
How is Ci right now?

09:25.160 --> 09:26.040
Wait.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.760
Only restrain him. Do not harm him.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.280
Rest assured, my lord.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.440
I've sent trusted men
to guard him closely.

09:42.240 --> 09:45.240
BOYA

09:54.480 --> 09:56.920
Look over here, Li.

10:03.120 --> 10:03.960
Ma'am!

10:04.480 --> 10:05.760
There's a letter from Kangjun.

10:14.200 --> 10:15.800
Is it from Ci? What does it say?

10:15.880 --> 10:16.800
I HEARD YOU HAD A SON.

10:16.880 --> 10:18.840
I HOPE YOU AND BI ZHI RETURN TO KANGJUN
TO ENJOY FAMILY TIME.

10:19.400 --> 10:20.680
It's from Father.

10:21.720 --> 10:25.400
He heard I have a son
and wants to meet Li.

10:25.480 --> 10:27.680
He hopes we can bring him back
to Kangjun for a while.

10:29.160 --> 10:32.440
I know grandparents have a special bond
with their grandkids.

10:33.720 --> 10:37.080
Father must be so happy
to be a grandfather now.

10:37.600 --> 10:39.440
He must have forgotten past arguments.

10:41.600 --> 10:42.760
I hope so.

10:46.720 --> 10:49.080
But Father really does love children.

10:50.280 --> 10:53.560
When we were young, he treated us so well.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.720
He's fallen asleep.

11:07.720 --> 11:10.400
I'll go find some fast horses.
We'll set out at once.

11:11.280 --> 11:12.360
No rush.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.640
We're going back to Kangjun.

11:22.080 --> 11:25.280
KANGJUN

11:29.520 --> 11:30.360
There they are.

11:46.640 --> 11:47.600
Fan, get down.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.400
- Father.
- Father.

11:56.480 --> 11:58.680
We've waited so long for you.

12:01.000 --> 12:03.240
Where are Mother, Uncle, and Ci?

12:03.320 --> 12:04.520
They're all waiting in the mansion.

12:07.000 --> 12:08.760
I heard you've been good to Fan.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.400
You often pick sour plums for her?

12:11.480 --> 12:12.400
Yes.

12:12.480 --> 12:15.000
I learned the recipe to pickle them
from a kitchen maid.

12:15.520 --> 12:16.400
She loves them.

12:16.840 --> 12:17.640
What a coincidence.

12:17.720 --> 12:20.360
The plums in Kangjun are ripe now.
They're in the West Hill.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.640
Go pick some for her.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.040
Let's have a taste as well.

12:23.120 --> 12:24.640
- Yes.
- Father.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.760
We've only just arrived.

12:25.840 --> 12:29.040
Don't send Bi Zhi
off on errands right away.

12:29.120 --> 12:32.040
Besides, back when Mother was in Boya,

12:32.120 --> 12:34.000
I stopped him from picking sour plums.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.840
He's a respected leader now.

12:43.920 --> 12:46.520
Since he's my son-in-law,

12:46.600 --> 12:48.600
he ought to show some filial piety.

12:51.440 --> 12:55.280
Earlier, I acted rashly,
driven by anger toward Wei Shao.

12:55.360 --> 12:56.720
I did something inappropriate.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.920
You and I share the same blood.

13:00.000 --> 13:02.000
I should treat Bi Zhi well.

13:03.640 --> 13:06.480
The two of you should hold
a proper wedding ceremony.

13:07.600 --> 13:10.640
Now that you have a son,
it's time to make it official.

13:13.320 --> 13:15.200
Father, I'll be right back.

13:16.360 --> 13:18.240
Good, don't be long.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.760
- Bi Zhi…
- Don't worry.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.240
I'll be right back.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.520
Come to the mansion with me.

13:26.600 --> 13:27.680
Li is still in the carriage.

13:27.760 --> 13:28.880
We'll fetch him in a moment.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.400
Bi Zhi! Come back!

13:35.480 --> 13:37.320
Father, what are you doing?

13:37.400 --> 13:39.160
- Gag her.
- Let me go!

13:39.240 --> 13:40.640
What are you doing?

14:12.560 --> 14:13.520
Bi Zhi!

14:15.240 --> 14:16.400
Bi Zhi,

14:16.480 --> 14:17.920
stop right now,

14:18.000 --> 14:19.000
or she'll get hurt.

14:22.760 --> 14:24.600
So, you're Bi Zhi,
the green-eyed stableman.

14:25.480 --> 14:27.360
Just as Xue Tai said,
you're hard to handle,

14:28.360 --> 14:29.720
but you love your wife deeply.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.840
All the better.

14:32.760 --> 14:34.880
You'll make a fine weapon
against Wei Shao.

14:40.520 --> 14:41.600
I once swore an oath

14:42.480 --> 14:44.320
that I would never harm
the Lord of Wei or Her Ladyship.

14:46.800 --> 14:47.920
In that case,

14:48.000 --> 14:48.880
she'll get hurt.

14:49.880 --> 14:50.680
Stop!

14:55.240 --> 14:56.120
Kneel.

15:03.480 --> 15:04.160
Kneel!

15:24.200 --> 15:25.360
From this day forth,

15:25.960 --> 15:28.280
be you a stableman or my slave,

15:28.360 --> 15:30.840
you will stay by my side
and obey my commands.

15:32.080 --> 15:33.160
If not…

15:39.840 --> 15:40.920
Well then,

15:41.000 --> 15:43.760
you can try and see whether
you're faster than my blade.

15:59.120 --> 16:03.080
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

16:05.400 --> 16:06.400
Stop.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.520
State your name and purpose.

16:07.600 --> 16:08.560
I'm Wei Liang from Wei State,

16:08.640 --> 16:11.120
here on the Lord of Wei's orders
to invite the Prefect of Kangjun to visit.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.640
General Wei, please wait a moment.

16:15.720 --> 16:17.040
General, Wei Liang has arrived.

16:17.120 --> 16:18.080
Shall we let him in?

16:25.880 --> 16:27.640
General Wei, you may enter.

16:43.080 --> 16:45.880
KANGJUN WHARF

16:51.120 --> 16:53.520
Shopkeeper, do you have any
fine orchids from Yanzhou?

16:53.600 --> 16:54.960
The fine ones are back at my home.

16:55.040 --> 16:56.920
They're costly, though. Still want them?

16:57.000 --> 16:57.880
Price is no issue.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.720
Give me the best.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.480
Sure. Follow me.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.200
Move aside!

17:03.280 --> 17:04.960
- Out of the way!
- Move it!

17:08.599 --> 17:11.079
Shopkeeper, has Kangjun
been peaceful lately?

17:11.960 --> 17:13.200
Thanks to the prefect,

17:13.280 --> 17:15.160
every home sleeps with
their doors wide open.

17:15.920 --> 17:18.440
But why are there
so many patrols on the street?

17:18.520 --> 17:20.240
I don't know why.

17:20.920 --> 17:23.079
There are more patrols lately,
that's true.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.040
Let's go.

17:51.120 --> 17:52.000
Governor.

17:57.920 --> 18:00.320
General, your arrival is sudden.
May I ask what brings you here?

18:01.240 --> 18:02.640
Her Ladyship misses her father,

18:02.720 --> 18:05.160
so His Lordship sent me here
to invite Prefect Qiao

18:05.240 --> 18:06.840
to stay in Yujun for a while

18:06.920 --> 18:08.400
until Her Ladyship gives birth.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.680
They can enjoy some family time.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.080
To invite the prefect?

18:14.360 --> 18:15.440
Manman is about to give birth.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.200
He is a man, after all.
He can't help much there.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.960
He'd only cause trouble
for the Lord of Wei.

18:19.040 --> 18:19.800
How about this?

18:19.880 --> 18:23.360
Once Manman gives birth safely,
I'll visit them with Ci.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.360
Governor, you're overthinking.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.800
It's no trouble at all.

18:27.240 --> 18:30.520
How about we ask Prefect Qiao
and hear his thoughts?

18:32.000 --> 18:34.160
My brother hasn't been well lately.

18:34.240 --> 18:37.280
He's resting at home now
and not seeing guests.

18:38.240 --> 18:39.320
He's sick?

18:39.960 --> 18:43.320
Then I should visit him
to show His Lordship's filial piety.

18:43.720 --> 18:45.280
I'll go right now…

18:50.800 --> 18:53.080
He just took some herbal soup
and is asleep.

18:53.480 --> 18:55.320
I'll send someone to check if he's awake.

19:00.040 --> 19:00.920
Mr. Zhang,

19:01.880 --> 19:02.800
go and take a look.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.920
Yes.

19:15.920 --> 19:18.760
This kind of small thing
should be left to servants.

19:18.840 --> 19:21.320
Why trouble your advisor with such things?

19:22.200 --> 19:24.200
Zhang Pu is more thoughtful.

19:27.480 --> 19:28.480
Where's Young Master Ci?

19:28.560 --> 19:30.600
I haven't seen him in a while.
I truly miss him.

19:31.560 --> 19:33.120
Ci went hunting in the hills.

19:35.160 --> 19:37.680
It's getting late and he's not back yet?

19:39.480 --> 19:41.720
He's still a kid and really playful.

19:45.240 --> 19:46.360
By the way,

19:46.440 --> 19:47.920
I heard in Boya

19:48.000 --> 19:51.320
that General Bi Zhi and his wife
were invited to Kangjun too.

19:51.400 --> 19:53.800
Did they bring their child?
May I visit them?

19:55.240 --> 19:58.240
General, must you ask about
every single member of my family?

20:10.080 --> 20:11.160
General,

20:11.240 --> 20:12.480
was Ma'am's delivery smooth?

20:24.240 --> 20:25.160
General,

20:25.240 --> 20:26.080
you…

20:34.720 --> 20:36.720
Governor, you want to side with Liu Yan?

20:38.160 --> 20:39.840
Since Wei Shao's lackey is here,

20:39.920 --> 20:41.320
there's no way you'll make it back alive.

20:43.040 --> 20:45.160
Bi Zhi, you green-eyed scum!

20:45.240 --> 20:46.600
You'd betray the Lord of Wei too?

20:50.240 --> 20:51.080
Bi Zhi,

20:51.680 --> 20:53.000
what are you waiting for?

20:56.880 --> 20:58.560
Don't you care about your wife and son?

21:09.560 --> 21:10.320
Go get him!

21:10.400 --> 21:11.720
Hurry! Go get him!

21:18.280 --> 21:19.320
My lady.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.840
I've prepared some food for Ci.

21:22.920 --> 21:24.160
By His Lordship's order,

21:24.240 --> 21:25.240
no one is allowed inside.

21:25.320 --> 21:26.480
Insolence!

21:26.560 --> 21:27.960
How dare you speak to me like this?

21:29.280 --> 21:30.680
Am I not the Lady of Yanzhou?

21:31.760 --> 21:33.800
I need to check the food box, my lady.

21:34.560 --> 21:36.640
Do you need to search me as well?

21:36.720 --> 21:37.920
I wouldn't dare.

21:38.000 --> 21:38.840
Let her in.

21:43.760 --> 21:45.520
- Aunt.
- Ci.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.640
- Ci.
- Aunt.

21:52.720 --> 21:54.000
What happened out there?

21:54.080 --> 21:55.320
How is my father?

21:55.920 --> 21:57.240
Why did Uncle lock me up?

21:57.320 --> 21:59.040
Don't call him Uncle anymore.

21:59.920 --> 22:02.560
He's allied himself with Liu Yan
and is plotting against the Lord of Wei.

22:03.000 --> 22:05.160
Your father and cousin
are locked away too.

22:05.240 --> 22:07.640
Even Bi Zhi is being forced
to serve them now.

22:08.400 --> 22:10.680
General Wei Liang came unexpectedly,
and they attacked him.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.440
We don't even know if he's still alive.

22:13.280 --> 22:16.040
Ci, your top priority now
is to get out of here,

22:16.120 --> 22:17.120
rescue General Wei Liang,

22:17.200 --> 22:18.480
and inform the Lord of Wei.

22:24.000 --> 22:24.880
My lady!

22:27.720 --> 22:28.560
Step aside!

22:28.640 --> 22:30.400
- Young Master Ci, calm down.
- Step back!

22:31.400 --> 22:32.200
- Step back!
- Make…

22:32.280 --> 22:33.280
Make way!

22:36.040 --> 22:37.920
Ci! Ci!

22:38.320 --> 22:39.800
Get out of the way, all of you!

22:39.880 --> 22:41.160
If anything happens to Ci,

22:41.240 --> 22:43.040
how will you explain it to the governor?

22:43.120 --> 22:43.840
Move!

22:43.920 --> 22:44.840
Go on.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.120
Ci?

22:47.200 --> 22:48.040
Move aside!

22:48.680 --> 22:49.640
Ci?

22:49.720 --> 22:50.960
Young Master Ci, please stay calm.

22:56.520 --> 22:57.400
Don't follow me.

22:58.760 --> 22:59.640
Aunt,

23:00.480 --> 23:01.320
take care.

23:03.200 --> 23:04.160
- Go get him!
- Ci!

23:04.240 --> 23:05.560
Ci! Ci!

23:05.640 --> 23:06.680
Are you all right, my lady?

23:06.760 --> 23:07.640
Ci…

23:07.720 --> 23:08.760
My lady.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.080
Stop right there!

23:11.560 --> 23:12.600
Go after him!

23:12.680 --> 23:13.640
Don't run!

23:13.720 --> 23:14.560
Stop!

23:41.240 --> 23:42.080
Stop!

23:42.160 --> 23:43.240
- Don't run.
- Don't run.

24:03.600 --> 24:04.520
Go get him!

24:28.640 --> 24:30.920
Bring the orchids to Wei and tell them,

24:31.000 --> 24:32.040
Boya has rebelled!

24:32.120 --> 24:33.120
Kangjun has rebelled!

24:34.000 --> 24:34.880
General!

24:38.960 --> 24:41.080
Tell Xiaotao not to wait for me!

25:49.720 --> 25:50.640
Xiaotao,

25:52.800 --> 25:54.320
don't wait for me.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.440
My lord, be careful.

26:24.840 --> 26:25.840
Where is Ci?

26:26.920 --> 26:27.920
He escaped.

26:28.000 --> 26:29.000
I've sent men after him.

26:29.080 --> 26:30.240
He escaped?

26:31.480 --> 26:33.080
Whatever happens, don't take his life.

26:35.320 --> 26:36.240
My lord.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.320
In this case,

26:38.400 --> 26:41.520
our secret plans will likely be exposed.

26:42.320 --> 26:44.120
Then we will no longer hide it.
Let's start the war.

26:44.200 --> 26:46.720
We'll attack Panyi
and catch them off guard.

26:47.640 --> 26:49.560
If we control the Yongning Canal,

26:49.640 --> 26:51.840
we control the lifeline of every region.

26:52.520 --> 26:54.080
Seriously?

26:54.160 --> 26:55.480
Panyi is heavily guarded.

26:55.560 --> 26:56.840
It's not easy to take.

26:56.920 --> 26:58.000
Exactly.

27:00.080 --> 27:02.000
That's up to you, Governor.

27:03.560 --> 27:05.040
Can you find a way

27:05.480 --> 27:06.960
to knock the gates of Panyi open?

27:09.720 --> 27:10.560
Well…

27:18.000 --> 27:19.800
Yang Feng, the Mayor of Panyi,

27:19.880 --> 27:22.280
once served my father closely.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.840
He's a slippery one though.

27:28.000 --> 27:29.440
Let's hope he doesn't stop us.

27:43.440 --> 27:45.880
PANYI CITY, WEI STATE

27:47.920 --> 27:49.800
PANYI

27:49.880 --> 27:52.080
WEI

27:57.760 --> 27:59.120
Open the gates!

27:59.200 --> 28:00.680
Open the gates now!

28:00.760 --> 28:02.160
Open the gates.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.680
Open the gates now!

28:04.200 --> 28:05.480
What's going on, General?

28:06.400 --> 28:07.560
Mayer, look.

28:07.640 --> 28:09.400
Why would they suddenly show up like this?

28:09.480 --> 28:10.760
Both the Governor of Yanzhou

28:10.840 --> 28:12.960
and the Commander of the Boya Forces

28:13.360 --> 28:14.640
have come here together.

28:14.720 --> 28:16.480
General, let me ask them.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.600
Governor,

28:19.160 --> 28:21.960
why have you brought troops here?

28:22.040 --> 28:23.160
Yang Feng,

28:23.680 --> 28:26.000
Liu Yan attacked Kangjun.

28:26.080 --> 28:28.200
Luckily, Bi Zhi saved us.

28:28.280 --> 28:30.920
Open the gates quickly. I seek refuge.

28:32.400 --> 28:34.120
Please wait a moment, Governor.

28:34.200 --> 28:35.000
General,

28:35.080 --> 28:38.920
Wei State and Yanzhou are bound
by both marriage and alliance.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.840
Please allow the family
of the late Lord Qiao

28:40.920 --> 28:42.440
to take shelter in the city,

28:42.520 --> 28:45.000
and send a message to Yujun without delay.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.560
Well…

28:47.400 --> 28:48.840
Thank you very much, General.

28:51.280 --> 28:53.360
All right. Open the gates!

28:53.440 --> 28:54.800
Open the gates now!

29:06.640 --> 29:08.520
Governor, please enter quickly.

30:17.240 --> 30:20.160
General… General Bi Zhi,
what are you doing?

30:20.480 --> 30:21.520
Yang Feng,

30:22.240 --> 30:24.440
I've allied with Liangya
to resist Wei State.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.480
From this day on,

30:27.040 --> 30:29.480
Panyi returns to Yanzhou's rule.

30:30.160 --> 30:33.240
You once served my father closely
and are a man of intelligence.

30:33.640 --> 30:34.720
I trust you know

30:35.880 --> 30:37.080
what must be done,

30:37.160 --> 30:38.320
don't you?

30:42.800 --> 30:43.760
Yes, I do.

30:44.800 --> 30:45.880
Governor,

30:45.960 --> 30:48.480
your march here with so many troops.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.960
Has Xindu noticed?

30:52.240 --> 30:53.000
Xindu?

30:58.920 --> 31:01.720
In this realm,
who could possibly rival Bi Zhi?

31:09.960 --> 31:10.800
True.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.880
And what about Zhen Zhi?

31:18.120 --> 31:18.800
Bi Zhi.

31:23.000 --> 31:25.960
He lacked your subtlety
and tried to stop us.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.480
He fell in the line of duty.

31:40.560 --> 31:41.520
Governor.

31:43.840 --> 31:44.600
My lord.

31:47.440 --> 31:50.160
Mayor Yang, please inform all regions

31:50.560 --> 31:53.000
that the sluice at Yongning Canal
is now under my control.

31:54.400 --> 31:58.800
All forces and nobles must reconsider
where their loyalties lie.

32:01.040 --> 32:01.880
Yes.

32:02.920 --> 32:03.760
I understand.

32:19.480 --> 32:22.240
PANYI, WEI

32:24.200 --> 32:28.400
QIAO

32:32.000 --> 32:33.400
You fell in the line of duty?

32:43.480 --> 32:45.240
If I had known this would happen,

32:45.320 --> 32:47.000
I would've had a drink with you…

32:51.440 --> 32:53.440
back in Rongjun.

33:05.880 --> 33:07.720
Liu Yan's evil heart never dies.

33:07.800 --> 33:09.760
If such a warmonger
gains control of the water source…

33:09.840 --> 33:10.560
GOVERNOR OF YENZHOU

33:10.640 --> 33:11.880
…how can the realm ever find peace?

33:11.960 --> 33:14.160
He wants me to join him?

33:14.240 --> 33:15.040
Never!

33:15.120 --> 33:16.560
I told them to follow the Lord of Liangya…

33:16.640 --> 33:17.680
GOVERNOR OF TAOZHOU

33:17.760 --> 33:19.400
…but they wouldn't listen.

33:20.200 --> 33:22.320
Luckily, we chose our side early.

33:22.400 --> 33:25.760
We might yet claim a share of the spoils.

33:27.560 --> 33:28.760
Wei State is too strong.

33:28.840 --> 33:29.760
GOVERNOR OF YAOZHOU

33:29.840 --> 33:32.600
I agreed to help build the canal
only as a temporary move.

33:32.680 --> 33:36.320
If Liangya State really defeats Wei State,

33:37.440 --> 33:38.680
that will be a good thing.

33:39.720 --> 33:41.080
Let's wait and see.

33:41.640 --> 33:44.200
PROCLAMATION: LIANGYA NOW
ACCEPTS PANYI'S SURRENDER

33:46.440 --> 33:47.640
My lord, your asthma is acting up again.

33:47.720 --> 33:49.240
Shall I call for the physician?

33:55.160 --> 33:56.520
Liu Yan…

33:57.440 --> 33:59.720
He is dead set on mutual destruction.

34:00.480 --> 34:03.680
We cannot let Shiyuan
get dragged into this mess.

34:03.760 --> 34:04.600
Yes.

34:12.920 --> 34:13.960
Young Master.

34:14.040 --> 34:15.280
Shiyuan, you're back.

34:20.880 --> 34:23.320
Son, you've been
guarding the border for a while.

34:23.880 --> 34:25.120
You've done well.

34:25.199 --> 34:26.480
It's time you came home.

34:27.440 --> 34:28.520
You've been away too long.

34:29.199 --> 34:30.239
I do miss you.

34:32.520 --> 34:35.719
Governor, I'd like to request command
of a military unit.

34:36.120 --> 34:37.760
Is there any unrest at the border?

34:39.159 --> 34:40.199
Are you hurt, son?

34:40.280 --> 34:41.120
No, it's fine.

34:46.920 --> 34:47.760
So,

34:48.600 --> 34:51.080
you want to reinforce Yujun?

34:53.440 --> 34:55.000
Liu Yan caught us off guard.

34:55.480 --> 34:57.840
I just need to help out for a few days
to ease Zhonglin's troubles.

34:57.920 --> 34:58.840
Shiyuan!

35:00.480 --> 35:01.520
Given the current situation,

35:02.000 --> 35:06.600
I've held back from attacking Wei State
out of respect for your ties with Wei!

35:06.920 --> 35:08.960
As for the rest, don't bring it up again.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.960
Governor!

35:12.280 --> 35:13.720
- Guards.
- Yes, my lord.

35:14.560 --> 35:16.000
Escort the Young Master to his chambers.

35:16.600 --> 35:18.680
You must be tired from the journey.

35:18.760 --> 35:21.400
Rest in your chambers
for the next few days.

35:25.000 --> 35:25.880
Young master,

35:26.320 --> 35:27.240
this way, please.

35:38.160 --> 35:42.200
ZHONGZHOU POST HOUSE, ZHONGZHOU

35:43.480 --> 35:45.440
My lady, General Xue Tai has arrived.

35:47.760 --> 35:48.800
My lady,

35:48.880 --> 35:52.160
the Lord of Liangya has announced
he has taken Panyi.

35:52.240 --> 35:53.280
Our plan has succeeded.

35:53.920 --> 35:54.800
Very well.

35:56.480 --> 35:57.600
In that case,

35:58.600 --> 36:00.760
I need the Governor of Zhongzhou
to meet me.

36:00.840 --> 36:03.120
Zhongzhou is a thousand li from Panyi.

36:03.200 --> 36:06.080
Even if they gathered troops,
their aid would be slow.

36:07.880 --> 36:09.960
Who said I planned to attack Panyi?

36:12.400 --> 36:13.640
What's your plan, my lady?

36:16.120 --> 36:18.800
Since Liu Yan has taken Panyi
and the Yongning Canal,

36:18.880 --> 36:20.320
Wei Shao surely won't sit still.

36:21.360 --> 36:22.840
The moment he moves,

36:24.240 --> 36:26.000
I'll strike straight for Yujun

36:27.600 --> 36:29.000
and wipe out the Wei clan.

36:30.520 --> 36:32.360
I didn't expect that to be your plan.

36:34.640 --> 36:38.000
The Lord of Liangya attacks Panyi
to rule the realm,

36:38.080 --> 36:39.400
but what I seek

36:40.120 --> 36:41.440
is so much more than that.

36:43.400 --> 36:46.000
I will walk over
the bones of the Wei clan,

36:47.360 --> 36:49.360
wade through their blood,

36:51.200 --> 36:54.000
and rise to the top, step by step.

36:58.600 --> 37:01.080
The humiliation the Weis inflicted on me…

37:05.000 --> 37:08.120
I shall return in full.

37:26.480 --> 37:27.240
Who's there?

37:27.320 --> 37:28.320
YUJUN, WEI STATE

37:31.160 --> 37:32.400
Who are you?

37:32.480 --> 37:33.600
My brother-in-law…

37:34.320 --> 37:35.320
Young Master Ci!

37:35.400 --> 37:36.480
Inform His Lordship!

37:51.400 --> 37:52.240
Ci.

37:53.040 --> 37:54.600
- You're awake.
- Manman.

37:55.360 --> 37:56.560
My lord.

37:58.800 --> 37:59.760
I sent Wei Liang

37:59.840 --> 38:01.480
to invite you and Father to visit.

38:01.560 --> 38:03.040
Why are you the only one back?

38:14.440 --> 38:15.360
Xiaotao.

38:18.840 --> 38:20.040
General Wei Liang

38:21.520 --> 38:23.320
asked me to give the orchids to you.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.400
General Wei Liang…

38:29.840 --> 38:30.880
He died fighting.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.440
Are you out of your mind?

38:42.920 --> 38:45.440
Did you hurt your head or something?

38:45.520 --> 38:46.360
He's such a big man.

38:46.440 --> 38:48.160
You say he's dead and that's it?

38:48.840 --> 38:52.120
We waited all night for you to wake up,
and what do you do?

38:52.200 --> 38:54.800
The first thing you say is
that Wei Liang's dead?

38:56.000 --> 38:58.280
Can you think before you speak?

38:58.360 --> 38:59.360
He has that huge shield.

38:59.440 --> 39:00.960
How could he die just like that?

39:01.040 --> 39:03.040
You're still alive,

39:03.120 --> 39:04.840
but why isn't he?

39:12.080 --> 39:13.560
Believe whatever you want.

39:14.480 --> 39:15.800
I'm going to do the laundry.

39:21.440 --> 39:22.280
Ci.

39:25.120 --> 39:25.960
What exactly

39:27.920 --> 39:29.200
do you mean by that?

39:36.000 --> 39:37.280
Just say it.

39:39.040 --> 39:40.040
Say it!

39:42.480 --> 39:43.520
General Wei Liang

39:45.440 --> 39:46.240
died fighting.

39:47.400 --> 39:49.600
Uncle was incited by Zhang Pu

39:49.680 --> 39:51.200
to ally with Liu Yan

39:51.760 --> 39:53.480
and rebel against you.

39:53.560 --> 39:54.920
Zhang Pu even drugged Father.

39:55.000 --> 39:56.760
Now, Father is blind.

39:56.840 --> 39:59.520
Uncle imprisoned me, Cousin,
and my nephew,

39:59.600 --> 40:01.800
and forced Bi Zhi to turn against us.

40:02.360 --> 40:03.400
I don't know why

40:03.480 --> 40:06.560
General Wei Liang came to Kangjun
to see me and Father.

40:07.440 --> 40:09.160
Out of fear that the truth would come out,

40:09.240 --> 40:10.560
Liu Yan ordered soldiers to attack us.

40:11.880 --> 40:13.400
We couldn't hold them off.

40:13.920 --> 40:16.200
General Wei Liang fought to
get me out of there,

40:16.280 --> 40:17.360
but he…

40:17.920 --> 40:18.960
He…

40:19.480 --> 40:20.640
It should've been me.

40:21.480 --> 40:22.440
It should've been me.

40:22.520 --> 40:24.600
Qiao Ci, look at me.

40:25.120 --> 40:26.800
Wei Liang went to fetch you, right?

40:27.480 --> 40:28.760
Where is he now?

40:29.600 --> 40:30.920
Look at me. Where is Wei Liang?

40:31.720 --> 40:33.440
He went to Yujun,
so tell me, where is he now?

40:34.280 --> 40:35.840
Look at me. Where is Wei Liang?

40:36.400 --> 40:37.800
Where is Wei Liang?

40:37.880 --> 40:38.720
Where is he?

40:38.800 --> 40:39.800
It should've been you.

40:39.880 --> 40:42.400
Why did it have to be him?
Why not a Qiao?

40:42.480 --> 40:43.360
Wei Xiao!

40:43.440 --> 40:44.400
My lord!

40:47.480 --> 40:48.200
Reporting!

40:48.880 --> 40:50.760
Liu Yan has taken Panyi with his troops.

40:56.000 --> 40:57.200
Pass down my orders.

41:00.280 --> 41:01.520
All troops, stay on alert.

41:02.320 --> 41:03.440
Tomorrow,

41:04.160 --> 41:05.440
we march on Panyi!
